## Article 292. Court of appeal instance

```catala
declaration scope Article292AppealCourt:
  input determination content AppealCourtDetermination
  output appellateAdministrativeCourtHasJurisdiction content YesNo
  output supremeCourtHasAppellateJurisdiction content YesNo
  output grandChamberHasAppellateJurisdiction content YesNo
  output haccAppealPanelHasJurisdiction content YesNo

scope Article292AppealCourt:
# Appellate administrative court reviews local court decisions
  label appellate_court definition appellateAdministrativeCourtHasJurisdiction under condition
    determination.firstInstanceCourtLevel = CourtLevel.LocalCourt
    consequence equals Yes

# Supreme Court reviews appellate court first-instance decisions
  label supreme_court definition supremeCourtHasAppellateJurisdiction under condition
    determination.firstInstanceIsSupremeCourt = No
    and determination.firstInstanceCourtLevel = CourtLevel.AppellateCourt
    consequence equals Yes

# Grand Chamber reviews Supreme Court first-instance decisions
  label grand_chamber definition grandChamberHasAppellateJurisdiction under condition
    determination.firstInstanceIsSupremeCourt = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# HACC Appeal Panel for sanctions cases
  label hacc definition haccAppealPanelHasJurisdiction under condition
    determination.isSanctionsCase = Yes
    and determination.isHACCAppeal = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_appellate definition appellateAdministrativeCourtHasJurisdiction equals No

  label no_supreme definition supremeCourtHasAppellateJurisdiction equals No

  label no_grand definition grandChamberHasAppellateJurisdiction equals No

  label no_hacc definition haccAppealPanelHasJurisdiction equals No
```

## Article 293. Right to appeal

```catala
declaration scope Article293RightToAppeal:
  input check content AppealRightCheck
  output hasRightToAppealResolution content YesNo
  output hasRightToAppealRulingSeparately content YesNo
  output nonParticipantAcquiresParticipantRights content YesNo

scope Article293RightToAppeal:
# Case participants may appeal resolution
  label participant_appeal definition hasRightToAppealResolution under condition
    check.isCaseParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Non-participant whose rights were decided may appeal
  label nonparticipant_appeal definition hasRightToAppealResolution under condition
    check.courtDecidedRightsOfNonParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_right definition hasRightToAppealResolution equals No

# Rulings may be appealed separately only if listed in Art 294
  label separate_appeal definition hasRightToAppealRulingSeparately under condition
    check.appealingSeparatelyAppealableRuling = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_separate definition hasRightToAppealRulingSeparately equals No

# Non-participant whose rights decided acquires participant rights
  label acquires_rights definition nonParticipantAcquiresParticipantRights under condition
    check.courtDecidedRightsOfNonParticipant = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_acquisition definition nonParticipantAcquiresParticipantRights equals No
```

## Article 294. Separately appealable rulings

```catala
declaration scope Article294SeparatelyAppealableRulings:
  input rulingSubject content SeparatelyAppealableRuling
  output canBeAppealedSeparately content YesNo

scope Article294SeparatelyAppealableRulings:
# All listed rulings can be appealed separately from resolution
  label appealable definition canBeAppealedSeparately equals Yes
```

## Article 295. Appeal deadlines

```catala
declaration scope Article295AppealDeadlines:
  input deadline content AppealDeadlineDetermination
  output appealWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output deadlineMayBeRestored content YesNo
  output oneYearAbsoluteDeadlineApplies content YesNo

scope Article295AppealDeadlines:
# Resolution: 30 days from pronouncement or full decision composition
  label resolution_thirty definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.appealingResolution = Yes
    and deadline.daysSincePronouncement <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# If abbreviated, count from full decision composition
  label resolution_abbreviated definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.appealingResolution = Yes
    and deadline.abbreviatedDecisionPronounced = Yes
    and deadline.daysSinceFullDecisionComposed <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Written proceeding: count from full decision composition
  label resolution_written definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.appealingResolution = Yes
    and deadline.writtenProceeding = Yes
    and deadline.daysSinceFullDecisionComposed <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

# Ruling: 15 days
  label ruling_fifteen definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    deadline.appealingResolution = No
    and deadline.daysSincePronouncement <= 15
    consequence equals Yes

# Restoration when full decision not served on day of pronouncement
  label restoration_service definition deadlineMayBeRestored under condition
    deadline.fullDecisionServedToAppellant = No
    consequence equals Yes

# Restoration for good cause
  label restoration_good_cause definition deadlineMayBeRestored under condition
    deadline.goodCauseForDelay = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# One year absolute deadline for prosecutor/authority
  label one_year definition oneYearAbsoluteDeadlineApplies under condition
    deadline.isProsecutorOrAuthority = Yes
    and deadline.oneYearSinceFullDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_one_year definition oneYearAbsoluteDeadlineApplies under condition
    deadline.isProsecutorOrAuthority = Yes
    and deadline.oneYearSinceFullDecision = No
    consequence equals No

  label deadline_expired definition appealWithinDeadline equals No

  label no_restoration definition deadlineMayBeRestored equals No
```

## Article 296. Form and content of appeal complaint

```catala
declaration scope Article296AppealForm:
  input check content AppealComplianceCheck
  output complaintMeetsFormRequirements content YesNo

scope Article296AppealForm:
# Complaint must meet all formal requirements
  label compliant definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.complaintInWrittenForm = Yes
    and check.courtFeePaid = Yes
    and check.groundsSpecified = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_compliant definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.complaintInWrittenForm = No
    consequence equals No

  label no_fee definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.courtFeePaid = No
    consequence equals No

  label no_grounds definition complaintMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    check.groundsSpecified = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 297. Filing procedure

```catala
declaration scope Article297AppealFiling:
  output filedDirectlyWithAppealCourt content YesNo

scope Article297AppealFiling:
# Appeal complaint filed directly with appeal court
  label direct_filing definition filedDirectlyWithAppealCourt equals Yes
```
